    36	/**
    37	 * Hook to handle file drops from the operating system into the Tauri window.
    38	 *
    39	 * Uses HTML5 Drag & Drop API (with dragDropEnabled: false in tauri.conf.json).
    40	 * This approach works better with transparent windows on macOS.
    41	 *
